{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4249, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 4000, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4254, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "fa80f293f35cf186f469f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "잘 부탁드립니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "お相手、よろしく。", "pointer_offset": 4004, "unit": "dialogue:6b113d1e581f8db2", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 5595, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f8b2f0bcf0d7f0b9f147f15781432f2ff8dff64cf1442f2ff1acf25af8aaf64cf944f243f95af154f0cef0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "이 시합에서는，//제 패가//보너스 패가 되어 있습니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合では、//私のパイが//ボーナスパイになっています。", "pointer_offset": 4008, "unit": "dialogue:21f459bdf4be0a22", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4330, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff149f0b8f0cf81442f2ff8b2f140f0b9f947f15af8bdf9a9f1d5f0d2f0e72f2ff1e1fbc1f1e2f1d5f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "이번 주제입니다．//이 중에서 어느 한 세트를//맞춰 주세요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題です。//この中の、どれか１組を//そろえてください。", "pointer_offset": 4012, "unit": "dialogue:55b94262f5ebafda", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4391, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f0cffac3f5f3f0c7f1578143f253f0f0f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "다음 딜러는，저네요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次の親は、私ですね。", "pointer_offset": 4016, "unit": "dialogue:f8746a909e3e20fa", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 5498, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0b2f248f0b9f15781432f2ff0e2f0e4f27af8b2f5f3f0c7f26bf0ef8144", "baseline_text": "이번에는，//대장님이 딜러예요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今度は、//隊長が親ですよ。", "pointer_offset": 4020, "unit": "dialogue:abb7ff0cbbeb1dcd", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4439, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0aff16bf143f0f481432f2ff0dff944f0b2f941fa99f16ff0a9f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "아무래도，//제가 이긴 것 같군요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "どうやら、//私の勝ちのようですね。", "pointer_offset": 4024, "unit": "dialogue:e5681b763322c0bd", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4474, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f0affb74f3d7f3d8f0b22f2ff293f344f0ccf955f271f345f0b2f0a9f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "아직 훈련이//부족했던 모양이군요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "まだまだ訓練が//足りなかったようですね。", "pointer_offset": 4028, "unit": "dialogue:cd18e7f6055ac1ce", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 5529, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3f0b9f157f7d1f0b2f14ff29ef0cef0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "다음에는…이기겠습니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次は……勝たせてもらいますよ。", "pointer_offset": 4032, "unit": "dialogue:ded4b59a6d6044d0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4546, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f0e2f0e4f27af7d12f2ff0cff2c3f0b9f957f0dff0e2f0a32f2ff2abf2f9f8c8f19cf0f4fb84f0a5f2528144", "baseline_text": "대장님…//다음에는 제대로//결판을 내도록 하죠．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長……//次はきちんと//決着をつけましょうね。", "pointer_offset": 4036, "unit": "dialogue:d66f171c1417d8a1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0011", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4593, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0adf0a4fb56f0e2f9f7f26af0e2f15781432f2ff2ccf0b18143f2ddf0ecf0b2f0b9f0ef81442f2ff2cef2cef2cef7d1", "baseline_text": "마지막 대전 상대는，//꽤나，강적이에요．//후후후…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "最後の対戦相手は、//かなり、強敵ですよ。//ふふふ……", "pointer_offset": 4040, "unit": "dialogue:89781b4fa07ffcf7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0012", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4646, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f771816081b82f2ff154f276f0aff0ef816081432f2ff0adf0a4f356f8f3f253f3b6f0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "짠～∈//있잖아요～，//마지막은 저랍니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "じゃ～ん！//なんとですね～、//最後はわたしなんです∈", "pointer_offset": 4044, "unit": "dialogue:434f85f42db9ef42", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0013", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4699, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f1ccf0e3f0b9f947f263f0a5f1572f2ff0d8f388f0faf1acf0aaf0a8f957f28af144f0ef81ac2f2ff280f8f3f271f272f29ef0a4f1d4f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "일본에서 말하는//그림자보스라는 건가요〓//잘은 모르겠지만요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ニッポンで言うところの//影の番長ってヤツですか〓//よくわかりませんけど。", "pointer_offset": 4048, "unit": "dialogue:2d1e743feadf817f", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0014", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4772, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2ca8143f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f8e1f24df36df7d12f2ff24cf0d3f94bf186f27cf0f1f0ef81b82f2ff56cf6c3f8f4f1cff0aff0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "그럼，오오가미 씨의 실력…//확인해 드릴게요∈//덤벼도 좋아요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "じゃ、大神さんの実力……//確かめてあげます！//かかってきていいですよ∈", "pointer_offset": 4052, "unit": "dialogue:4b3fccaf542693f0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0015", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4843, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f2b5f25af2a9f0d2f944f3a1f259f8c8f16e", "baseline_text": "토너먼트가 끝났을 때", "kind": "ascr", "source": "勝ち抜き戦が終わった時", "pointer_offset": 4056, "unit": "dialogue:bb0e5833a13689be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0016", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4866, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f491f0a5f186f469f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "축하드립니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おめでとうございます。", "pointer_offset": 4060, "unit": "dialogue:b84710c5e1d20d4f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0017", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4889, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0e2f0e4f27af7d1f273f274f0a2f0bcf0cff1c781432f2ff0cff8bcf9a9f2488143f15af1f2f0dbf144f0ef8148", "baseline_text": "대장님…괜찮으시다면，//다시 한 번，어떠신가요？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長……よろしければ、//もう一度、いかがですか？", "pointer_offset": 4064, "unit": "dialogue:a291c3c7e8937cd2", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0018", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4938, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f2c9f29ef0cef0b8f0cf81442f2ff0a5f0a4f1d4f7d12f2ff349f186f0aef0a4f957f287f29ef0cef0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "알겠습니다．//하지만…//봐드리지는 않겠습니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わかりました。//ですが……//手加減はいたしませんよ。", "pointer_offset": 4068, "unit": "dialogue:80d3d1f700827996", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0019", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4991, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef0a9f0eff7d12f2ff15afaa8f94af1b5f0f0f0ef81442f2ff0d8f2ca8143f0cffac3f14ff16af0b98144", "baseline_text": "그렇군요…//어쩔 수 없네요．//그럼，다음 기회에．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうですか……//仕方ありませんね。//では、次の機会に。", "pointer_offset": 4072, "unit": "dialogue:fb6b0a11d5a88922", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0020", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 5046, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f0aff16bf143f0f481432f2ff0dff944f0b2f941f271f345f0b2f0a9f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "아무래도，//제가 이긴 모양이군요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "どうやら、//私の勝ちのようですね。", "pointer_offset": 4076, "unit": "dialogue:e5681b763322c0bd", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
